  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: চমুকৈ, মই ব্যক্তিগত সহায়কাৰী আৰু সঙ্গী৷<br/>আপোনাৰ লগত সদায়ে সাজু৷
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: হাই, মই Cortana৷<br/>কামবিলাক সহজ কৰি তুলিবৰ বাবে আৰু এইবিলাক কৰাত আপোনাক সহায় কৰিবৰ বাবে মই ইয়াত আছো৷
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=AS-IN: Cortana হৈছে আপোনাৰ সহযোগী, যি আপোনাক চুপাৰ, হিৰ'য়িক বা সময় সাপেক্ষ হৈ থকাত সহায় কৰে৷<br/><br/>Cortana-ক ব্যক্তিগতকৃত অভিজ্ঞতা আৰু প্ৰাসঙ্গিক পৰামৰ্শ প্ৰদান কৰিবলৈ দিয়ক, Microsoft-এ আপোনাৰ অৱস্থান আৰু অৱস্থান ইতিবৃত্ত, সম্পৰ্ক, ভইচ ইনপুট, স্পিচ্ আৰু হস্তলিখন পেটাৰ্ণ, টাইপ কৰা ইতিবৃত্ত, অনুসন্ধান কৰা ইতিবৃত্ত, কেলেণ্ডাৰৰ বিৱৰণ, বাৰ্তা আৰু এপ্প্‌সমূহৰ পৰা সামগ্ৰী আৰু যোগাযোগৰ ইতিবৃত্ত, আৰু আপোনাৰ ডিভাইচত থকা অন্য তথ্য সংগ্ৰহ কৰে৷ Microsoft Edge-ত, Cortana-এ আপোনাৰ ব্ৰাউজিং ইতিবৃত্ত ব্যৱহাৰ কৰে৷ আপুনি টোকাবহীত Cortana-এ কি মনত ৰাখিব, Microsoft Edge-ত Cortana-এ কি অক্ষম কৰিব সদায়েই মেৰামতি কৰিব পাৰে৷
